  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:58:24.867107Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:58:24.868129Z",
  "totalBlocks": 54,
  "translatedBlocks": 54,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "913bab4739025505",
      "translationZh": "本文将向你展示如何用 🤗 Optimum Habana（Gaudi2 与 🤗 Transformers 库之间的桥梁）轻松部署 BLOOM 这类数千亿参数的大语言模型。正如下文的基准所示，这将让你的推理速度快于目前市面上的任何 GPU。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8325f3392ffcc993",
      "translationZh": "随着模型越来越大，把它们部署到生产环境做推理变得愈发具有挑战性。硬件与软件都出现了许多创新来应对这些挑战，下面我们深入看看如何高效克服！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53c7921d5495a0a6",
      "translationZh": "BLOOMZ",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06bb1c0b0ee8d758",
      "translationZh": "BLOOM 是一个 1760 亿参数的自回归模型，训练目标是补全文本序列。它能处理 46 种自然语言和 13 种编程语言。BLOOM 作为 BigScience 计划的一部分设计和训练，是一项汇聚了全球大量研究者与工程师的开放科学项目。最近，另一个架构完全相同的模型发布了：BLOOMZ——它在多个任务上微调过 BLOOM，带来更好的泛化与零样本（zero-shot）[^1] 能力。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cc9fd9cea44a401",
      "translationZh": "如此大的模型给训练与推理的内存和速度都提出了新挑战。即使 16 位精度，一个实例也需要 352GB 才装得下！你目前可能很难找到内存这么大的设备，但 Habana Gaudi2 这样的先进硬件确实让以低延迟对 BLOOM 和 BLOOMZ 模型做推理成为可能。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3a1613924fae0c83",
      "translationZh": "Habana Gaudi2",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed81aac1da29e9ed",
      "translationZh": "Gaudi2 是 Habana Labs 设计的第二代 AI 硬件加速器。单台服务器包含 8 个加速设备（称为 Habana 处理单元，HPU），每个有 96GB 内存，为装载超大模型留出了空间。不过，如果计算太慢，光装得下也没意思。幸运的是，Gaudi2 恰恰在这点出色：它与 GPU 的不同在于其架构能让加速器并行执行通用矩阵乘法（GeMM）等运算，从而加速深度学习工作流。这些特性让 Gaudi2 成为 LLM 训练与推理的优秀候选。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d90d150ca7ebc14",
      "translationZh": "Habana 的 SDK SynapseAI™ 支持 PyTorch 和 DeepSpeed，用于加速 LLM 训练与推理。SynapseAI 图编译器会优化图中累积操作的执行（如算子融合、数据布局管理、并行化、流水线与内存管理，以及图级优化）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1ff0f1eb9fa837c",
      "translationZh": "此外，对 HPU graphs 和 DeepSpeed-inference 的支持最近刚加入 SynapseAI，它们非常适合延迟敏感型应用，正如下面的基准所示。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e1c6d7ae63a40dd",
      "translationZh": "所有这些特性都集成在 🤗 Optimum Habana 库中，因此在 Gaudi 上部署模型非常简单。快速入门页面见这里。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "989f9f204114116c",
      "translationZh": "如果你想获得 Gaudi2 的访问权限，请前往 Intel Developer Cloud 并按照这份指南操作。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f2e7732a6956e5b",
      "translationZh": "基准测试",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af48eda344e4f40e",
      "translationZh": "本节我们给出 BLOOMZ 在 Gaudi2、第一代 Gaudi 和 Nvidia A100 80GB 上的早期基准。虽然这些设备内存不小，但模型太大，单个设备装不下一个 BLOOMZ 实例。为解决这个问题，我们使用 DeepSpeed——一个通过多项内存与速度改进来加速模型、使其适配设备的深度学习优化库。具体来说，我们这里依赖 DeepSpeed-inference：它引入了模型（或流水线）并行等特性，以充分利用可用设备。对 Gaudi2，我们使用 Habana 的 DeepSpeed 分支，它增加了对 HPU 的支持。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e0e7d293043c8cf6",
      "translationZh": "延迟",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2adbf02b124d9d2",
      "translationZh": "我们测量了两个不同规模 BLOOMZ 的延迟（单样本批次），都是数十亿参数以上：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6c1ec50fe9f7a7f",
      "translationZh": "1760 亿参数",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26692e9e102bb64f",
      "translationZh": "70 亿参数",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b4717193c1c6276",
      "translationZh": "运行使用 DeepSpeed-inference、16 位精度、8 个设备，并使用键值缓存。注意，虽然 CUDA graphs 目前与 DeepSpeed 的模型并行不兼容（DeepSpeed v0.8.2，见这里），Habana 的 DeepSpeed 分支支持 HPU graphs。所有基准都以贪婪方式生成 100 个 token 输出。输入提示是：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40e2f9d9c2dca8a7",
      "translationZh": "\"DeepSpeed is a machine learning framework\"",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c58823dc68b6b1f6",
      "translationZh": "用 BLOOM 的分词器共 7 个 token。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8d59435cc1c7af3",
      "translationZh": "推理延迟结果见下表（单位：秒）。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e501b4082514af2",
      "translationZh": "设备数",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91812c84f0c453f1",
      "translationZh": "Gaudi2 延迟（秒）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acab5e2c9a6ad690",
      "translationZh": "A100-80GB 延迟（秒）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbadaed746524a1a",
      "translationZh": "第一代 Gaudi 延迟（秒）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53c7921d5495a0a6",
      "translationZh": "BLOOMZ",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb7274a4a35a0c6",
      "translationZh": "BLOOMZ-7B",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb7274a4a35a0c6",
      "translationZh": "BLOOMZ-7B",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32cdb2f6315e9f02",
      "translationZh": "更新：随着 Optimum Habana 1.6 和 SynapseAI 1.10 发布，上述数字已更新：Gaudi2 上 BLOOMZ 相比 A100 达到 1.42 倍加速。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1821ac5480532159",
      "translationZh": "Habana 团队最近在 SynapseAI 1.8 中加入了对 DeepSpeed-inference 的支持，从而快速实现了 1000 亿参数以上模型的推理。对 1760 亿参数检查点，Gaudi2 比 A100 80GB 快 1.42 倍。较小的检查点也有有趣的结果：BLOOMZ-7B 上 Gaudi2 比 A100 快 2.89 倍！还有一点值得注意：它能在模型并行下受益，而 A100 在单设备上更快。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2917a2e6f8d1969",
      "translationZh": "我们也在第一代 Gaudi 上跑了这些模型。它比 Gaudi2 慢，但从价格角度看很有意思：AWS 上的 DL1 实例每小时约 13 美元。第一代 Gaudi 上 BLOOMZ-7B 的延迟是 2.387 秒。因此对 70 亿检查点，第一代 Gaudi 的价格性能比优于每小时 30 多美元的 A100！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1adab4e67580204",
      "translationZh": "我们预期 Habana 团队会在后续 SynapseAI 版本中优化这些模型的性能。例如，在上次基准中我们看到 Gaudi2 跑 Stable Diffusion 推理比 A100 快 2.2 倍，随着 Habana 最新优化，现在已进一步提升到 2.37 倍。随着 SynapseAI 新版本发布并集成进 Optimum Habana，我们会持续更新这些数字。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "deb8cca1467f382c",
      "translationZh": "在整个数据集上运行推理",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58247e83015eb1e5",
      "translationZh": "我们写的脚本让你的模型对整个数据集补全句子。适合在 Gaudi2 上用自己的数据尝试 BLOOMZ 推理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c2a9f64e111f752",
      "translationZh": "以 tldr_news 数据集为例。它包含多篇文章的标题和正文（可在 Hugging Face Hub 上可视化）。我们只保留 content 列，并把每个样本截断到前 16 个 token，让模型用 50 个新 token 生成序列其余部分。前五个样本如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "064b321041f3b595",
      "translationZh": "下一节我们解释如何使用我们写的脚本完成这个基准，或把它应用到你喜欢的任何 Hugging Face Hub 数据集！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "87b4fc951eb8822a",
      "translationZh": "如何复现这些结果？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be61e3305a5c4a5d",
      "translationZh": "在 Gaudi2 和第一代 Gaudi 上为 BLOOMZ 做基准的脚本在这里。运行前请确保按 Habana 的说明安装了最新版 SynapseAI 和 Gaudi 驱动。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4fdb113ac596883",
      "translationZh": "然后运行以下命令：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0b9b6260c602998",
      "translationZh": "最后，可以这样启动脚本：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "405d28ee6548b3f5",
      "translationZh": "多节点推理可参照 Optimum Habana 文档中的这份指南。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e349165c7ee16d8d",
      "translationZh": "你还可以用参数 --dataset_name my_dataset_name 从 Hugging Face Hub 加载任意数据集，获取用于生成的提示。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61579b7003e950a1",
      "translationZh": "本基准使用 Transformers v4.28.1、SynapseAI v1.9.0 和 Optimum Habana v1.5.0 完成。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9c74bb0be99e690",
      "translationZh": "GPU 方面，这里是得出本文前面所述结果的脚本（使用说明见这里）。使用 CUDA graphs 需要静态 shape，🤗 Transformers 尚不支持；你可以使用 Habana 团队写的这个仓库来启用。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dd6fde2c3e6283b",
      "translationZh": "本文我们看到 Habana Gaudi2 执行 BLOOMZ 推理比 Nvidia A100 80GB 更快。而且无需编写复杂脚本——🤗 Optimum Habana 提供了易用的工具，在 HPU 上运行数十亿参数模型的推理。Habana SynapseAI SDK 的未来版本预计会继续提速；随着 SynapseAI 上的 LLM 推理优化不断推进，我们会定期更新这一基准。我们也期待 Gaudi2 上 FP8 推理带来的性能红利。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a24df6cffca5684",
      "translationZh": "我们还展示了第一代 Gaudi 的成绩。对较小的模型，它的表现能与 A100 持平甚至更好，而价格只有约三分之一。对于运行 BLOOMZ 这样的大模型推理，它是使用 GPU 之外的不错选择。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b8aaecfc256b7ec",
      "translationZh": "如果你有兴趣用最新的 AI 硬件加速器和软件库加速你的机器学习训练与推理工作流，请了解我们的 Expert Acceleration Program。想进一步了解 Habana 方案，请阅读我们的伙伴关系并在此联系他们。想了解 Hugging Face 在让 AI 硬件加速器易于使用方面的努力，请看我们的硬件合作伙伴计划。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aea370bca4ee9e70",
      "translationZh": "相关主题",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e956b887c0522858",
      "translationZh": "更快的训练与推理：Habana Gaudi-2 对比 Nvidia A100 80GB",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86ed188677049eea",
      "translationZh": "借助 DeepSpeed 用 Hugging Face 与 Habana Labs Gaudi 更快更省地训练大规模 Transformer 模型",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cda9254718c28c89",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如有问题，欢迎通过 GitHub 或论坛联系我。也可以在 LinkedIn 上与我联系。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e51fa205515b45e",
      "translationZh": "[^1]：“零样本”指模型在新的、未见过的输入数据上完成任务的能力，即没有提供过任何此类数据的训练样本。我们给模型一个提示和一段自然语言描述的指令，告诉它我们想让它做什么。零样本分类不包含任何完成目标任务的示例。这与单样本或少样本分类不同——那些任务包含所选任务的一个或几个示例。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
